{
  "_note": "**近一个月(44)** —— 35 格(5 行 × 7 列)跨事项热力 + 底部三项统计。入参 {mask}。\n刻意做**近 35 天的连续窗口**而不是「本月日历」:日历要知道当月第一天是星期几才能排版,\n而那要在 flow 里做星期计算(formatDate 的星期格式跨端不一,属于 parseDate 安全子集之外)。\n连续窗口零风险,信息量一样,而且最后一格恒是今天、不会出现「月初只有两格」的空卡。\n⚠️ 与 today(44) 的分工:today 是**今天的横切面**(哪几件打了),这张是**一个月的纵深**。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "入参先落地成 data 域的键(§9.5 #3),再由 resultFilter 透出去 —— **RCN 只看得见 flow 的输出**,shell params 不进渲染域。`mask` 决定卡上打不打码(打码开关在事项页,经 pickWidgets 的 per-item params 传进来)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mask",
        "value": "${mask}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "跨事项聚合的真源 agg={total,byDay},由页面 JS 的 computeAgg() 落盘。",
      "id": "agg",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "agg",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "total",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${agg.total},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "byDay",
        "value": "${agg.byDay}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayMs",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "按自然日归零再相减 —— 直接拿 nowMs 减 86400000,同一天的上午/下午会算出不同的「昨天」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "e0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#DCDDE0|#33353B,#EDEEF0|#20232A)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#DCDDE0|#33353B,#7ABEA0|#3A896C)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#DCDDE0|#33353B,#54AE86|#40A880)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#DCDDE0|#33353B,#2E9E6B|#45C793)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-2937600000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${byDay},${k0}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${v0},0),${e0},if::(ge::(calc::(${v0}*4),calc::(${total}*3)),${p3},if::(ge::(calc::(${v0}*2),${total}),${p2},${p1})))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-2937600000),dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k1",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-2851200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${byDay},${k1}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${v1},0),${e0},if::(ge::(calc::(${v1}*4),calc::(${total}*3)),${p3},if::(ge::(calc::(${v1}*2),${total}),${p2},${p1})))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
