          "May",
          "Jun",
          "Jul",
          "Aug",
          "Sep",
          "Oct",
          "Nov",
          "Dec"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "日期锚(标准 §4.4)。35 格自己不带任何日期,而桌面小组件的封面缓存 key 不含时间维度 —— 不写窗口起止,这张卡停在上个月和刚渲的一模一样。起点 = 今天 − 34 天(与第 0 格 `k0` 的 2937600000ms 逐字对应)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mStartLbl",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-2937600000),MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「mStartLbl」按语言出:中文 9月25日 / 英文 Sep 25(doc/overseas-first.md §5,英文不再出现 09-25)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_m_mStartLbl",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-2937600000),MM),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_d_mStartLbl",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-2937600000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mStartLbl",
        "value": "${_m_mStartLbl}月${_d_mStartLbl}日"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_e_mStartLbl",
            "value": "$[index::(${_MON},calc::(${_m_mStartLbl}-1))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "mStartLbl",
            "value": "${_e_mStartLbl} ${_d_mStartLbl}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_note": "时效锚(card-design-system §3)。⚠️ 与内容日期分开一个键:锚本轮保持 MM-dd 不本地化(doc/overseas-first.md §5 例外,四端 / 全仓锚统一处理),轴标签等内容日期才按语言出。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "atLbl",
